    values:originalText "(1) Sections 1, 2 and 55 commence on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent.  (2) The amendment of the Seat of Government (Administration) Act 1910 contained in the Schedule commences on the day declared under section 57.  (3) The remaining provisions of this Act (including the other amendments in the Schedule) commence on a day or days to be fixed by Proclamation." ;
