doc:sec-6-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6 Functions of the Authority" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The functions of the Authority are:  (a) to prepare and administer a National Capital Plan;  (b) to keep the Plan under constant review and to propose amendments to it when necessary;" ;
