concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-33 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33 Constitution of Authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Authority shall consist of a Chairperson and 4 other members, as provided by this section.  (2) The Chairperson may be appointed on a full-time or part-time basis.  (3) If the Chairperson is appointed on a full-time basis, the Chairperson shall also be the Chief Executive and there shall be 4 non-executive members.  (4) If the Chairperson is appointed on a part-time basis, there shall be a separate Chief Executive and 3 other non-executive members.  (5) The Chief Executive (if any) appointed under subsection (4) shall be appointed on a full-time basis.  (6) The non-executive members shall be appointed on a part-time basis.  (7) The members shall be appointed by the Governor-General, and hold office on such terms and conditions (in respect of matters not provided for by this Act) as are determined by the Governor-General." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Authority shall consist of a Chairperson and 4 other members, as provided by this section.  (2) The Chairperson may be appointed on a full-time or part-time basis.  (3) If the Chairperson is appointed on a full-time basis, the Chairperson shall also be the Chief Executive and there shall be 4 non-executive members.  (4) If the Chairperson is appointed on a part-time basis, there shall be a separate Chief Executive and 3 other non-executive members.  (5) The Chief Executive (if any) appointed under subsection (4) shall be appointed on a full-time basis.  (6) The non-executive members shall be appointed on a part-time basis.  (7) The members shall be appointed by the Governor-General, and hold office on such terms and conditions (in respect of matters not provided for by this Act) as are determined by the Governor-General."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f7d6b252bf3adbcc9b890ba1729cc3efd810df7934e88ab37e8509cb138a44cf" ;
