    skos:prefLabel "49 Delegations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-49 ;
    values:originalText "The Authority may delegate all or any of its powers under this Act to:  (a) the Chief Executive;  (b) a member of the staff of the Authority; or  (c) a person whose services have been made available under section 47.   Miscellaneous  Part VIII  Section 51  Australian Capital Territory (Planning and Land Management) Act 1988 Compilation date: 1/7/18 Registered: 6/8/18" ;
