concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-52 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52 Application of Acts Interpretation Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52 ;
    values:originalText "Neither paragraph 46(1)(a) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 nor paragraph 13(1)(a) or (b) of the Legislation Act 2003 applies to:  (a) the Territory Plan; or  (b) an instrument made, granted or issued under paragraph 29(1)(b)." ;
    skos:definition "Neither paragraph 46(1)(a) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 nor paragraph 13(1)(a) or (b) of the Legislation Act 2003 applies to:  (a) the Territory Plan; or  (b) an instrument made, granted or issued under paragraph 29(1)(b)."@en ;
