    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "before establishment of Executive  (1) Until the establishment of the Executive on Self-Government Day:  (a) references in the Canberra Water Supply (Googong Dam) Act 1974 to the Executive shall be read as references to the Minister;  (b) references in that Act to the Territory shall be read as references to the Commonwealth or a Commonwealth authority; and  (c) section 6A of that Act has no effect.  (2) Any steps taken under that Act by the Minister before Self-Government Day have effect on and after that Day as if they had been taken by the Executive.   Transitional provisions  Part X Continuation of NCDC policies  Division 3  Section 62  Australian Capital Territory (Planning and Land Management) Act 1988 Compilation date: 1/7/18 Registered: 6/8/18" ;
