concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-62 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62 NCDC policies to continue in effect"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-62 ;
    values:originalText "Where:  (a) before the commencing day, an NCDC policy was in published form and had been notified in the Commonwealth Gazette; and  (b) the policy was in operation immediately before that day; the policy continues in effect, subject to sections 65 and 66." ;
    skos:definition "Where:  (a) before the commencing day, an NCDC policy was in published form and had been notified in the Commonwealth Gazette; and  (b) the policy was in operation immediately before that day; the policy continues in effect, subject to sections 65 and 66."@en ;
