concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-64 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "64 Effect of NCDC policies during transition period"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-64 ;
    values:originalText "During the transition period, the Authority, the Territory or a Territory authority shall not do any act that is inconsistent with an NCDC policy while it is in effect under this Part." ;
