concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-73 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73 NCDC policies may be varied by Territory planning authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-73 ;
    values:originalText "(1) At any time during the transition period, the Territory planning authority may vary an NCDC policy.  (2) A variation by the Territory planning authority:  (a) shall relate to one or more particular blocks or sections of land in the Territory; and  (b) shall be made in accordance with this Division.  (3) A variation has no effect to the extent that it is inconsistent with a variation made by the Authority under Division 4." ;
    skos:definition "(1) At any time during the transition period, the Territory planning authority may vary an NCDC policy.  (2) A variation by the Territory planning authority:  (a) shall relate to one or more particular blocks or sections of land in the Territory; and  (b) shall be made in accordance with this Division.  (3) A variation has no effect to the extent that it is inconsistent with a variation made by the Authority under Division 4."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "abb0007766dec4876fa43af894e208fbad6899881a1c2308e3ab744ed901456c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-73-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-73-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-73-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
