concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-79 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79 Publication and commencement of approved variation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-79 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Executive shall publish notice of the approval of the draft variation in the Territory Gazette and specify the address where copies of the variation may be inspected and bought.  (2) The variation takes effect on publication of the notice of approval.   Transitional provisions  Part X Plan of lay-out of the City of Canberra  Division 6  Section 80  Australian Capital Territory (Planning and Land Management) Act 1988 Compilation date: 1/7/18 Registered: 6/8/18" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Executive shall publish notice of the approval of the draft variation in the Territory Gazette and specify the address where copies of the variation may be inspected and bought.  (2) The variation takes effect on publication of the notice of approval.   Transitional provisions  Part X Plan of lay-out of the City of Canberra  Division 6  Section 80  Australian Capital Territory (Planning and Land Management) Act 1988 Compilation date: 1/7/18 Registered: 6/8/18"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e6b290e30fb91ebaec695798dfe83970e01e1377a0dce03cb8919bdd8a53cfad" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-79-ss-1 ;
