concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-act-1988-sec-83 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "83 Assets, rights and liabilities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-83 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to section 82, assets, rights and liabilities of the NCDC existing immediately before the repeal of the NCDC Act vest in a body or bodies specified in writing by the Minister.  (2) In specifying a body for the purposes of subsection (1), the Minister shall have regard to which body or bodies will perform the relevant functions of the NCDC after the repeal of the NCDC Act.  (3) In this section: body includes the Commonwealth.   Transitional provisions  Part X Transfers following repeal of NCDC Act  Division 7  Section 84  Australian Capital Territory (Planning and Land Management) Act 1988 Compilation date: 1/7/18 Registered: 6/8/18" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to section 82, assets, rights and liabilities of the NCDC existing immediately before the repeal of the NCDC Act vest in a body or bodies specified in writing by the Minister.  (2) In specifying a body for the purposes of subsection (1), the Minister shall have regard to which body or bodies will perform the relevant functions of the NCDC after the repeal of the NCDC Act.  (3) In this section: body includes the Commonwealth.   Transitional provisions  Part X Transfers following repeal of NCDC Act  Division 7  Section 84  Australian Capital Territory (Planning and Land Management) Act 1988 Compilation date: 1/7/18 Registered: 6/8/18"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "63c2d5fcfe46e0fb9ebd171cc8839e7aa21452cc1b86d4e2616599a5929734e6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
